  <description>
    <p>
      AceOffice is an office suite for people coming from Pages, Numbers and Keynote. It opens
      Word, Excel and PowerPoint files (and your old iWork files), with a clean toolbar, a format
      sidebar, templates and page thumbnails. LibreOffice does the work underneath.
    </p>
